stands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands key information  in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Review of Possessive Pronouns and Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Compare possessive adjectives and pronouns in this chart:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"07\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Possessive Adjectives </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Possessive Pronouns </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's my juice.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's mine.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That's your coffee.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That coffee is yours.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's his computer.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The computer is his.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's her bag. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The bag is hers.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Those are our books.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Those books are ours.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's their car.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The car is theirs.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Review of the Present Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about current actions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Current actions are things that are happening NOW.  <br/><br/>Remember, to ask questions, you use the phrases:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  What <span class=\"strong\">is</span> he do<span class=\"strong\">ing</span>?<br /> What <span class=\"strong\">is</span> your mother do<span class=\"strong\">ing</span>?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You make the Present Continuous tense negative by adding  <span class=\"strong\">not</span> after the verb  <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> and before the  <span class=\"strong\">verb-ing</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I am not looking for anything right now. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He is not eating dinner. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "She isn't playing video games."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to borrow "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take something from someone and give it back later "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I borrow some money?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are the words to review. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inside "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "located in something or someplace"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is raining ... I'm staying inside."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "same "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "exactly like another"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are in the same class."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "blonde "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "yellow color, used for hair"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: She has blonde hair."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "party "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a social event where people eat, drink and/or dance "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you want to come to the party?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have to   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to need to; must "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to meet a friend."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "maybe "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "possibly "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:      Can you come to the party? <br><span class=\"strong\">Trisha</span>:      Maybe ..."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stay  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to remain in a place; to not leave "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is raining. I am staying here!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Just kidding "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "say this after you make a joke "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Your notes are bad! Just kidding!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob11aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le03ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a role from the role card."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (4-6 lines) with your partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are not going to the party. Your friend calls. Tell them why you are not going to the party.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Your friend is not at the party. Call them and ask them where they are.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about things that happen regularly."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about things happening at the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use 3 target words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe something that belongs to me or someone else."}]}], "type": "sena"}